OL,3,ADozens of co-ordinated arson attacks
OL,4,Ahit southern Thailand
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost were reported in Narathiwat
OL,7,Fprovince, with others occurring in
OL,8,Fneighbouring Yala and Pattani.
